              "text": "ભૂગોળ (bhūgoḷ) is a learned loan from Sanskrit bhūgola, \"the globe\", which EtymDB lists as borrowed from Sanskrit. It is built from bhū, \"earth\", and gola, \"ball\" (CDIAL 4321)."
